  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>科技RPG字体</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">说明</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">得益于这款现代、独特且清晰易读的科技感字体，你的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升。本字体专为&nbsp;<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>整合包制作，现已面向公众公开！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字体基于MADType设计的热门Google字体<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Aldrich\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aldrich</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字体采用开放字体许可证（OFL）授权。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/632/aldrich-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截图（来自DarkRPG）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/567/85/tech-image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即选购服务器并与好友同乐！点击&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅 &amp; 使用优惠码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 立减25！</span></p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
